     "id": "id3",
     "cls": "style_SkipStroke_2 shape-with-text",
     "style": "height: 196px; left: 36px; position: absolute; top: 10px; width: 266px; z-index: 1; ",
     "contentCls": "text-content Normal_External_266_196",
     "contentStyle": "padding: 0px; ",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "tag": "#text",
       "v": "\n              "
      },
      {
       "tag": "div",
       "attrs": {
        "class": "Normal"
       },
       "c": [
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "style": "padding-top: 0pt; ",
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "This trip took my brother and me to several exotic locations in Southern Africa. "
            },
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "The main focus of the trip was a visit to the Desert Rhino Camp in Northern Namibia. Our cousin Jeff Muntifering is associated with the "
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "title": "http://desertrhino.org/",
            "href": "http://desertrhino.org/"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "Save the Rhino Trust"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": ", and we were lucky to have him as a guide for this part of the trip. "
            },
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "style": "padding-bottom: 0pt; ",
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "We also visited Cape Town, the impressive sand dunes of Sossusvlei in the Namib Desert in Western Namibia, Victoria Falls, and Chobe National Park and the Okavango Delta in Northern Botswana. "
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n              "
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "tag": "#text",
       "v": "\n            "
      }
